        <detaileddescription>
<para>Mesh to PointCloud Generated from function <computeroutput>MR::meshToPointCloud</computeroutput>. Parameter <computeroutput>mesh</computeroutput> can not be null. It is a single object. Parameter <computeroutput>saveNormals</computeroutput> has a default argument: <computeroutput>true</computeroutput>, pass a null pointer to use it. Parameter <computeroutput>verts</computeroutput> defaults to a null pointer in C++. Never returns null. Returns an instance allocated on the heap! Must call <computeroutput><ref refid="MRPointCloud_8h_1ab779f06f061af58a1905e4d5b5e23e20" kindref="member">MR_PointCloud_Destroy()</ref></computeroutput> to free it when you&apos;re done using it. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
